    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "en": "pthread_setaffinity_np(3)",
      "ja": "pthread_setaffinity_np(3)"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "en": ". On Windows, maps\nthe bytes in cpumask to a bitmask and uses SetThreadAffinityMask() which\nreturns the previous affinity setting.",
