      "index": 223,
      "en": "tid",
      "ja": "tid"
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "en": ". The thread name is copied, with the trailing NUL, into the buffer\npointed to by ",
      "ja": "。スレッド名を、末尾のNULを含めて、次の引数が指すバッファへコピーします: "
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "en": "name",
      "ja": "name"
    },
    {
