    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "en": "name",
      "ja": "name"
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "en": ".\nThe buffer should be large enough to hold the name of the thread plus the trailing NUL, or it will be truncated to fit\nwith the trailing NUL.",
      "ja": "。バッファには、スレッド名と末尾のNULを格納できる十分な大きさが必要です。足りない場合は、末尾のNULを含めて収まるよう名前を切り詰めます。"
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "en": "It’s undefined behavior to call this after the thread has terminated.",
      "ja": "スレッド終了後の呼び出しは未定義動作です。"
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "en": "Not supported on Windows Server 2016, returns ",
